  "id": "anandamide",
  "term": "anandamide",
  "definition": "Anandamide, also called AEA, is one of the body’s endocannabinoids, which are chemical messengers in the endocannabinoid system. In this system, it is part of the signaling network involved in brain communication, regulation of neurotransmitters, inflammation, and behavior.",
